OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Manchester's 'super-profit'
OL,4,Adeal with City owners has paid out so
OL,5,Afar
OL,6,
OL,7,FManchester City Council has made just
OL,8,Funder #3m from a deal to share in the
OL,9,Fso-called "super-profits" from
OL,10,Fdevelopments built on its land by
OL,11,FManchester City's owners.
OL,13,FA deal struck in 2014 meant the council
OL,14,Fwould receive payments if the profits
OL,15,Fmade by Abu Dhabi United Group (ADUG)
OL,16,Fon schemes in Ancoats and New Islington
OL,17,Fexceeded a certain level.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
