OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Manchester's 'super-profit'
OL,4,Adeal with City owners has paid out so
OL,5,Afar
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Prof Adam Leaver, co-author of a
OL,8,F2022 report by the University of
OL,9,FSheffield into the council's
OL,10,Frelationship with ADUG, said commercial
OL,11,Fsecrecy around the arrangements meant
OL,12,Fit was hard to know if the council got
OL,13,Fthe best value it could.
OL,15,FThe council said it expected another
OL,16,Fpayment soon, and that the regeneration
OL,17,Fhad been worth #1.25bn to the city.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
